{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mpme5PEbujsRbN27Vreowd","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /private/tmp/h-GXZZj1/README.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2401dd5-517c-4210-9fb0-9d2da94a3b73","uuid":"03ec7946-4119-4767-a968-70448d58906c","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:19:26.275Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-GXZZj1/README.md","oldString":"Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so","newString":"Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt is split into blocks (instructions / profile / one block per fact) with\n`cache_control` markers (see `build_system`) so a `save_fact` only re-caches the new fact, and","originalFile":"# pace-bot\n\nA coaching chat bot on Claude for a small running/cycling club. It is stateless\nby design: each message rebuilds the system prompt (coaching rules + the athlete's\nprofile, zones, goal and long-term facts from `data/athletes.json`), picks the tools\nthe message might need (`save_fact` and `log_session` always, planning or race tools\nwhen keywords match) and runs a short tool-use loop. `save_fact` is how the bot\nremembers durable things an athlete tells it; the next message sees the fact in\nits system prompt. Every API call appends its `usage` object to `logs/usage.jsonl`.\n\nRun it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type\nmessages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs\n`COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).\nRequires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":5,"newStart":12,"newLines":6,"lines":[" messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`)."," Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","+prompt is split into blocks (instructions / profile / one block per fact) with","+`cache_control` markers (see `build_system`) so a `save_fact` only re-caches the new fact, and the tool-loop rounds and follow-up"," messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Mpme5PEbujsRbN27Vreowd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
